# Native ABI for the SDL shell.
#
# The full WASM export unit also contains the browser's controller registry and
# the wasm32 memory-size intrinsic. Compiling that unit natively creates
# unresolved WASM-only symbols. Keep the native shell's ABI explicit and add
# each desktop controller only with its own lifecycle and frame boundary.

